--! assertDiagnostic error E_IMPORT_ITEM_NOT_FOUND
-- §3.2.2: an import item that fails to resolve is reported with family
-- kappa.name.unresolved, so the payload MUST include the unresolved
-- spelling and the candidate spellings considered for typo suggestions.
-- std.bytes exports 'bytesLength', edit distance 1 from the misspelled
-- item 'bytesLenght' (an adjacent transposition), in exactly the
-- admissible kind set (the module's exported names), so a
